which https://compcert.org/download.html names as the source distribution of version 3.18,
downloaded on 2026-10-26, SHA-256 564b312b3ed3162f02605f0108feb555bd28fe7a80b97ea269c546bcc60c1cf0
and SHA-512 764ff4cea9e8504337610f8c922d3b18790601df92515e7bb56b90601469bf2af881819dba54d9d7c3bb1cea87887062925e1003ec07078be86c0376eb3b7cd5,
